    <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Data Space" id="id-2042138269f443debb811d7830eea2ba">
      <documentation>Definition: The term Data Space refers to a type of data relationship between trusted partners who adhere to the same high level standards and guidelines in relation to data storage and sharing within one or many Vertical Ecosystems.

Source: Gaia-X

Source reference: https://gaia-x.eu/what-is-gaia-x/deliverables/data-spaces/

