    <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="geoJSON" id="id-2b1cf667191e405ca56a950d04c6e0a4">
      <documentation>Description: GeoJSON is a format for encoding geospatial data in JSON (JavaScript Object Notation). It provides a standard and flexible way to represent geographic features, such as points, lines, and polygons, along with their associated attributes.

Publisher: Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF)

