    <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="RDF-XML" id="id-3db1b4f829e74f3bba688d78780c815c">
      <documentation>Description: RDF-XML (Resource Description Framework XML) is a syntax format used to represent metadata and structured data in the form of Resource Description Framework (RDF) triples. RDF-XML provides a way to encode and exchange data using XML (eXtensible Markup Language) syntax.

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-syntax-grammar/

