    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationInterface" name="eTendering" id="id-97401a0dbea54b1e913a81e5f8ff4cb1">
      <documentation>Definition: eTendering refers to the capability of providing access to specific functionalities related to tendering processes through web-based APIs (Application Programming Interfaces). This allows external systems or applications to interact with the eTendering platform to perform tasks such as retrieving tendering information, submitting bids, or querying tender results.

Source: Publications Office of the European Union

Source reference: https://ted.europa.eu/TED/main/HomePage.do

LOST view: TVA-API Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/ETenderingApplicationInterface

EIRA traceability: eira:WebServiceApplicationInterface

ABB name: egovera:ETenderingApplicationInterface

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-01-18

</documentation>
