      <property key="skos:example" value="One example of Ethereum's application is in the field of decentralized finance (DeFi). DeFi platforms built on Ethereum enable users to access financial services without relying on traditional intermediaries, such as banks. Users can lend, borrow, trade, and earn interest on their cryptocurrencies directly through smart contracts, eliminating the need for a centralized authority. This opens up opportunities for financial inclusion and innovation, allowing individuals worldwide to participate in the global financial system."/>
