    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Keycloak" id="id-27672a5e648a48a7a27bed2cbe08e432">
      <documentation>Description: Keycloak is an open-source access management system that enables organizations to manage user authentication, authorization, and identity management for their applications and services. It provides a centralized platform for secure user authentication, single sign-on (SSO), and identity federation across multiple applications and systems.

Publisher: Keycloak

Source: https://www.keycloak.org/

