    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="SEMIC Core Vocabularies" id="id-40ba68507d5e4bd0ad750a740742de6a">
      <documentation>Description: The Core Vocabularies can be used by public administrations to attain a minimum level of semantic interoperability for e-Government systems. The Handbook explains how to (a) design new data models that extend the Core Vocabularies; and (b) map existing data models to the Core Vocabularies. 

