    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="W3C Organization" id="id-fa01416b34224bf79aac69a394a31e89">
      <documentation>Description: The Organization Ontology is a standardized representation of organizational structures, roles, and relationships within the field of Linked Data and the Semantic Web. It provides a framework for describing and modeling various aspects of organizations, such as their hierarchy, departments, employees, and roles.

